// SysAdmin/IT support track content pool — flashcards + drills covering IT support fundamentals
// (ticketing, ITIL, troubleshooting methodology), networking (OSI/TCP-IP, DNS/DHCP, subnetting,
// firewalls), classic on-prem systems administration (Windows Server/Active Directory, Linux
// server admin, virtualization), scripting/automation (Bash/PowerShell), monitoring, and
// backup/disaster recovery. Deliberately framed from the enterprise IT/helpdesk angle rather than
// cloud-native DevOps (see devops.ts for that track) — some conceptual overlap (Linux basics,
// scripting) is expected between adjacent professions. Cats match TRACK_GROUP_ORDER.sysadmin in
// roadmap.service.ts exactly.
